The block above is the standard AGPL-3.0 short notice, but the COMPLETE license
text (~660 lines) must accompany it for the license to be valid and for GitHub
to detect it. The environment that scaffolded this file has no internet access
to fetch it. From the repo root on a machine with internet, run ONE of:

    curl -L https://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0.txt -o LICENSE
    # or: wget -O LICENSE https://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0.txt

The copyright line and the commercial-license offer live in NOTICE, so they are
not lost when this file is replaced with the canonical text.
